<% content_for :seo_title, t('seo.blog.title') %>
<% content_for :seo_description, t('seo.blog.description') %>
<% content_for :seo_keywords, t('seo.blog.keywords') %>

<section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
  <% if I18n.locale == :fr %>
    <header class="mb-10">
      <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-wide text-purple-300">Blog musical interactif</p>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mt-3 mb-4">
        Blog Tube'NPlay: actus musique, gameplay et decouverte d'artistes
      </h1>
      <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg">
        Bienvenue sur le blog de Tube'NPlay. Retrouve ici nos conseils pour progresser dans le jeu, nos analyses des tendances musicales
        et nos focus sur les artistes emergents.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
      <article class="bg-gray-800 border border-gray-700 rounded-xl p-6">
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-purple-300 mb-2">Gameplay</p>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-2">Comment gagner plus de points sur Tube'NPlay</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 mb-4">
          Optimise tes sessions: likes pertinents, regularite quotidienne et progression intelligente vers les paliers concert.
        </p>
        <span class="text-sm text-gray-400">Article a venir</span>
      </article>

      <article class="bg-gray-800 border border-gray-700 rounded-xl p-6">
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-purple-300 mb-2">Decouverte musicale</p>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-2">Artistes emergents: pourquoi le format swipe change la donne</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 mb-4">
          Le swipe musical favorise une ecoute active et offre une nouvelle visibilite aux talents independants.
        </p>
        <span class="text-sm text-gray-400">Article a venir</span>
      </article>

      <article class="bg-gray-800 border border-gray-700 rounded-xl p-6">
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-purple-300 mb-2">Tendances</p>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-2">Playlists 2026: les genres a suivre pour booster tes sessions</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 mb-4">
          Afro, rap, pop, electro: les genres les plus engages et comment les utiliser pour varier ton experience de jeu.
        </p>
        <span class="text-sm text-gray-400">Article a venir</span>
      </article>

      <article class="bg-gray-800 border border-gray-700 rounded-xl p-6">
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-purple-300 mb-2">Produit</p>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-2">Les nouveautes Tube'NPlay: progression journey et recompenses concert</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 mb-4">
          Toutes les evolutions du jeu: systeme de points simplifie, jalons 2 000 / 4 500 et experience mobile plus fluide.
        </p>
        <span class="text-sm text-gray-400">Article a venir</span>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 text-gray-300">
      <p>
        En attendant les prochains articles complets, lance une partie et vis l'experience Tube'NPlay.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
        <%= link_to "Explorer les playlists", playlists_path, class: "bg-purple-600 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-purple-500 transition-colors" %>
        <%= link_to "Nous contacter", contact_path, class: "border border-purple-500 text-purple-300 px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-purple-500 hover:text-white transition-colors" %>
      </div>
    </div>
  <% else %>
    <header class="mb-10">
      <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-wide text-purple-300">Interactive music blog</p>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mt-3 mb-4">
        Tube'NPlay Blog: music trends, gameplay tips and artist discovery
      </h1>
      <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg">
        Welcome to the Tube'NPlay blog. Discover practical tips to progress faster, music trend breakdowns and spotlights on emerging artists.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
      <article class="bg-gray-800 border border-gray-700 rounded-xl p-6">
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-purple-300 mb-2">Gameplay</p>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-2">How to earn more points on Tube'NPlay</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 mb-4">
          Improve your sessions with smarter likes, daily consistency and better progress management toward concert rewards.
        </p>
        <span class="text-sm text-gray-400">Article coming soon</span>
      </article>

      <article class="bg-gray-800 border border-gray-700 rounded-xl p-6">
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-purple-300 mb-2">Music discovery</p>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-2">Emerging artists: why swipe-based listening changes everything</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 mb-4">
          Swipe interactions create active listening habits and offer independent artists a stronger path to visibility.
        </p>
        <span class="text-sm text-gray-400">Article coming soon</span>
      </article>

      <article class="bg-gray-800 border border-gray-700 rounded-xl p-6">
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-purple-300 mb-2">Trends</p>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-2">2026 playlists: genres to follow for better sessions</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 mb-4">
          Afro, rap, pop and electro: the genres driving engagement and how to use them to diversify your gameplay.
        </p>
        <span class="text-sm text-gray-400">Article coming soon</span>
      </article>

      <article class="bg-gray-800 border border-gray-700 rounded-xl p-6">
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-purple-300 mb-2">Product updates</p>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-2">Tube'NPlay updates: journey progression and concert milestones</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 mb-4">
          Follow the latest product improvements: simplified points, 2,000 / 4,500 milestones and smoother mobile play.
        </p>
        <span class="text-sm text-gray-400">Article coming soon</span>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 text-gray-300">
      <p>
        New long-form articles are coming soon. In the meantime, start a game and explore Tube'NPlay directly.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
        <%= link_to "Explore playlists", playlists_path, class: "bg-purple-600 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-purple-500 transition-colors" %>
        <%= link_to "Contact us", contact_path, class: "border border-purple-500 text-purple-300 px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-purple-500 hover:text-white transition-colors" %>
      </div>
    </div>
  <% end %>
</section>
